<title>UK: Dec Russian gas oil exports by sea ease - trade.</title>
<headline>Dec Russian gas oil exports by sea ease - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seaborne exports of Russian gas oil eased 1.6 percent to 1.279 million tonnes in December from 1.3 million tonnes in November, shipping sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shipments from Ventspils on the Baltic Sea rose 4.2 percent to 814,000 tonnes from 781,000 tonnes while shipments from the Black Sea ports of Novorossiisk, Tuapse and Odessa fell 10 percent to 465,000 tonnes from 519,000 tonnes, the sources said.</p>
<p>Shipments from all four ports totalled around 1.2 million tonnes in October.</p>
